DataIntersection joins unique ascending supplier_code keys; A/input 0 contains proposals and B/input 1 contains one current warehouse version. 
|Record|Fields (? nullable)|
|---|---|
|A|supplier_code string, rebate number?|
|B|supplier_code string, rebate number?|
