This DataIntersection has WardArrival(ward_id:string,effective_at:date) at input 0 and WardCurrent(ward_id:string,ward_sk:long,valid_from:date) at input 1. All columns are required. Each side is uniquely keyed and ascending on ward_id. The closure output columns are ward_sk:long, valid_from:date, valid_to:date, is_current:boolean.

