```

Fix this ceramic-tile change-log Reformat before the history expander. Events are sorted tile,at with strictly increasing times per tile. Emit a first-version delta for every tile, then only finish changes within that tile. A first version has initial=true and null old_finish; null and empty finish are distinct states. Equal finishes on different tiles must not suppress a first version.

Input TileEvent(tile:string!,finish:string?,at:date!). Output TileDelta(tile:string!,initial:boolean!,old_finish:string?,finish:string?,at:date!).

```ctl
//#CTL2
boolean have = false;
string tile;
string finish;
function integer transform() {
    boolean sameTile = have && tile == $in.0.tile;
    if (have && finish == $in.0.finish) return SKIP;
    $out.0.tile = $in.0.tile;
    $out.0.initial = !sameTile;
    $out.0.old_finish = sameTile ? finish : null;
    $out.0.finish = $in.0.finish;
    $out.0.at = $in.0.at;
    tile = $in.0.tile; finish = $in.0.finish; have = true;
    return ALL;
}
```

